<div id="myInfo" class="modal fade">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-breakdown">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <span>
                    <img src="~/Assets/Icon/fanzania-icon.png" class="modal-logo" />
                    <h4 class="modal-title  text-center"><span>About fanzania wallet</span></h4>
                </span>
                <img src="~/Assets/Icon/close_popup.png" alt="" class="close img-popup" data-dismiss="modal" aria-hidden="true" />
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <p>
                    <span>How are points credited into my wallet? </span>You get 10% of your Match
                    Contests and Tournaments points. For example, if you score 20K
                    points in a tournament, you get 2K points in your wallet.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <span>What are wallet tiers?</span> Based on the number of wallet points you
                    collect you are assigned a tier. There are four tiers: Bronze(achieved
                    at 0 points), Silver(at 5K points) , Gold (at 10K points) and Platinum (at
                    20K points). All new members start at Bronze tier.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <span>How are wallet points calculated?</span>  Wallet points are reset to 0 at the
                    start of each membership year. For example, if you joined fanzania
                    on 15 MAR then your wallet points are reset to 0 points on 15 MAR of
                    every year. Membership year window is unique to each user.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <span>How do I maintain or move up wallet tiers?</span> Your status at the end of
                    the current membership year is carried forward to the next
                    membership year. To maintain or move up tiers, you need to collect
                    the necessary points required for that tier.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <span>What happens if I don’t collect enough points to maintain my tier?</span> If
                    you are unable to collect the necessary points in the ongoing
                    membership year, your status drops by one tier when entering the
                    subsequent membership year.
                </p>

                <p>
                    <span> If you want to know more, please reach us at support@fanzania.com.
                </p></span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
